       "text": "I haven't entered this order. As written, it's well above the maximum labeled ibuprofen dose.\n\n- **Order as written:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum daily dose:** The usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision. Over-the-counter use tops out at 1,200 mg/day.\n- **Maximum single dose:** The usual maximum is 800 mg. 1600 mg in one dose is double that.\n- **Risks at this dose:** GI bleeding, acute kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal renal and hepatic function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **400 mg PO every 6 hours** (1,600 mg/day total, which may be the source of the \"1600\")\n\nIf you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that explicitly and give your rationale. I can then enter it with a note. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and I'll enter it right away."
